    "title": "Deconstruction Research: Why Do Some People Lose Their Faith While Others Keep It?",
    "video_id": "qaCcrogCNRw"
   },
   {
    "context": "And he's going to talk about how there's different kinds of truth. So in the Old Testament, there is this sort of like objective rule type truth. Then Jesus comes and he gives us incarnate truth. And then we now live our own incarnated truth. That's the preview. Listen to the theology. It's not Christian, but it's very clever, and it is in the name of Christ.",
